  "verification_evidence": "For M. villosus and M. okinawensis, DSMZ medium 282 (year 2014) was used, with the following modifications: 0.14 g K2HPO4 was replaced with 0.183 g K2HPO4·3H2O, and 0.01 g Fe(NH4)2(SO4)2·6H2O was replaced with 7 mg FeSO4·7H2O, without the usage of resazurin. ... gassed once or twice per day with an H2/CO2 test gas mixture (20 vol% CO2 in H2).",
